# Android (Bubblewrap TWA): only the inputs are committed; the Gradle project is regenerated from twa-manifest.json.
# Keystores, passwords and build outputs (.aab/.apk) never enter the repo.
android/*
!android/twa-manifest.json
!android/README.md
*.jks
*.keystore
*.aab
*.apk
*.idsig
# iOS (Capacitor): ios/App is committed; the web bundle is rebuilt by `npm run build:ios`
ios-www/
